t]] to taste\n\n== Special equipment ==\n\n* [[Cookbook:Blender|Blender]]\n* [[Cookbook:Skillet|Skillet]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# In a [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]], blend tofu and ¼ cup water for about 2 minutes, or until smooth\n# Add remaining ¾ cup water and process until blended.\n# In a large skillet, [[Cookbook:Sautéing|sauté]] onion for about 5 minutes.\n# Add mushrooms and thyme, and sauté 5 minutes more.\n# Add wine and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] for 5 minutes.\n# Add tofu mixture and simmer until mushrooms are wilted.\n# Stir in soy sauce, and adjust salt to taste.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* Using less water and/or adding some flour turns this into a delicious cream sauce for [[Cookbook:Pasta|pasta]].\n\n[[Category:Recipes using mushroom|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tofu|{{PAGENAME}}]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Mushroom Tofu Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"10.5 oz soft (silken) tofu","sourceText":"10.5 oz soft (silken) tofu","amountText":"10.5 oz soft (silken) tofu","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 ½ cups water","sourceText":"1 ½ cups water","amountText":"1 ½ cups water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 medium onion, chopped","sourceText":"1 medium onion, chopped","amountText":"1 medium onion, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"8 oz mushrooms, thickly sliced","sourceText":"8 oz mushrooms, thickly sliced","amountText":"8 oz mushrooms, thickly sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tsp thyme","sourceText":"1 tsp thyme","amountText":"1 tsp thyme","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"½ cup dry red wine","sourceText":"½ cup dry red wine","amountText":"½ cup dry red wine","amount":null,"